<title>ITALY: Cofide H1 1996 pretax loss of 9.5 bln lir.</title>
<headline>Cofide H1 1996 pretax loss of 9.5 bln lir.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>(billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>Group consolidated results</p>
<p>    Turnover			    6,932.5   vs   6,453.3</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    362.6   vs     132.8</p>
<p>    Pretax loss			     9.5   vs     504.3 loss</p>
<p>    Shareholders equity	     5,203.2   vs   5,344.8</p>
<p>    Net debt			    1,477.5   vs   1,598.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Cofide is the De Benedetti family holding company.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
